    "number": "2.57",
    "section": "Adhyāya 2 — Sāṅkhya (Discrimination)",
    "devanagari": "यः सर्वत्रानभिस्नेहस्तत्तत्प्राप्य शुभाशुभम्। नाभिनन्दति न द्वेष्टि तस्य प्रज्ञा प्रतिष्ठिता॥2.57॥",
    "iast": "yḥ sarvatrānabhisnehastattatprāpya śubhāśubham nābhinandati na dveṣṭi tasya prajñā pratiṣṭhitā",
    "conceptIds": ["gita-sankhya"],
    "interpretiveNotes": [{"note": "Kashmir Series of Texts and Studies No. LXIV (1943): Bhagavadgītā with Sarvatobhadra of Rājānaka Rāmakantha, ed. Madhusudan Kaul Shastri; Sanskrit-only source, English rendering original to this project."}],
    "translation": "Nowhere attached, meeting good-ill neither rejoices nor hates; wisdom founded.",
